  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……またそれ、やってるのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、トランプの扱い、\r\nすごく上手くなったと思わない？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そろそろ特技の欄に\r\n書いてもいいくらいよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はは、すっかりハマったみたいだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、そうね\r\nこうやって、出来ることが増えて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アイドルって、本当に楽しいわ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか\r\nそれならよかった",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──ねえ、プロデューサー\r\nポーカーのルールは知ってる？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\nああ、なんとなくだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それじゃあ、\r\n１回だけ付き合ってくれない？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………そうだな\r\n１回だけなら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふっ\r\nやっぱりプロデューサー、私に甘いわね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんなことは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ふふっ、そうかしら",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……というか、\r\nポーカーってふたりでも出来るものだったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "出来るわよ\r\nふたりでやる時はね──……",
