  {
    "id": 2013008110150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "プロデューサーから見て、\r\n──私はどう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……\r\nどうして、そんなこと聞くんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ただ、気になっただけよ\r\nアナタが私に甘くて、心配性なのはどうしてかしらって",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………\r\n夏葉は……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "努力家で、自分に対してストイックで……\r\nだけど他人に対しては、すごく優しい",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分を律することができる強さがあって、\r\n弱さをさらけ出せる強さもある",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ふふ、ええ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉が自分を甘やかさないから\r\n代わりに、そうしたくなるし",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "無理してないかって、心配にもなる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつも全力だから、必死に追いかけないといけない\r\n負けないように頑張ろうって、思わされる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そういう女の子だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ、ありがとう\r\nでも、少し褒めすぎじゃないかしら",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アナタは私を強いって言ってくれたけど\r\n私、まだまだよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──それに、負けないようにって\r\nアナタを追いかけてるのは、私のほうなのに",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110220,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……だから\r\nポーカーでも、負けないわ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300811/2013008110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、そうきたか\r\nでも、俺だって悪くないぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013008110230,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……いいえ、残念だけど\r\n今回は私の勝ちよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
